00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:21.750
I'm going to try to
simulate that load using

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:24.420
the images I found
in this data set,

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:26.240
again, provided by
Google for free.

00:12:29.369 --> 00:12:31.440
If it could switch to
a demo again, please.

00:12:35.128 --> 00:12:37.450
Thank you.

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:40.300
So just to explain
again what is going on,

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:44.680
I have one photo here of
this construction site.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:47.840
And I have a simple web page
that is blank right now.

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:54.140
If I switch to my
