00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:42.230
First is just the breadth and
the depth of services and APIs

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:44.660
that Google Cloud
Platform has to offer.

00:23:44.660 --> 00:23:48.800
We've been doing technology
for 18, 19 years now.

00:23:48.800 --> 00:23:51.671
We've been working on Machine
Learning for a decade now.

00:23:51.671 --> 00:23:53.420
And we would like our
users to have access

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:57.020
