services from databases

00:23:57.020 --> 00:24:01.790
to Machine Learning to
monitoring, that power

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:03.710
product like Google Photos.

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:05.390
And you can have
access to all of that.

00:24:05.390 --> 00:24:09.590
And as you saw, all it takes
