00:24:09.590 --> 00:24:12.290
And second, more
specific to our app,

00:24:12.290 --> 00:24:15.080
is each service is very
specific and independent

00:24:15.080 --> 00:24:18.860
and there is one thing it does
and it does it really well.

00:24:18.860 --> 00:24:20.970
We make sure our latencies
are extremely low.

00:24:20.970 --> 00:24:26.690
We make sure they can scale
up and down on their own.

00:24:26.690 --> 00:24:29.690
And as my team
started growing, they

00:24:29.690 --> 00:24:31.910
can control their own
independent deployment

00:24:31.910 --> 00:24:36.350
processes further bringing
