00:44:37.401 --> 00:44:37.900
standard.

00:44:37.900 --> 00:44:40.807
So what's the guidance on
running a caching fleet

00:44:40.807 --> 00:44:41.890
when connecting from Flex?

00:44:45.265 --> 00:44:46.865
KARAN GOEL: Does
Justin know that?

00:44:46.865 --> 00:44:49.121
JUSTIN BECKWITH: Sorry.

00:44:49.121 --> 00:44:49.620
Yes.

00:44:49.620 --> 00:44:51.870
So we have a cloud
Memcache service

00:44:51.870 --> 00:44:53.650
that's currently in alpha.

00:44:53.650 --> 00:44:56.335
So if folks are
interested, pop into our,

00:44:56.335 --> 00:44:57.960
we have a Slack
channel for App Engine,

00:44:57.960 --> 00:45:02.524
by the way, or contact Karan
and we can get you in touch

00:45:02.524 --> 00:45:05.190
