00:45:14.160 --> 00:45:15.930
And they run in the
same zones that we're

00:45:15.930 --> 00:45:17.495
running App Engine Flexible.

00:45:17.495 --> 00:45:18.870
So if you're
looking for Memcache

00:45:18.870 --> 00:45:20.120
either those are good options.

00:45:23.540 --> 00:45:25.950
KARAN GOEL: OK well, thanks
